Rewrite using `[IsLocalRing.jacobson_eq_maximalIdeal ⊥ bot_ne_top]`. Introduce `hu`. Establish `hu' : IsUnit ((Scheme.ΓSpecIso (CommRingCat.of V)).inv.hom a)` using `hu`. Use `hu'.map (Scheme.ΓSpecIso (CommRingCat.of V)).hom.hom` as an intermediate fact. Rewrite `this` using `[Iso.inv_hom_id_apply]`.

